<title>UK: KPC to make Santa Fe statement later today-source.</title>
<headline>KPC to make Santa Fe statement later today-source.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) will likely make an announcement later today on the planned sale of its British-based subsidiary Santa Fe Exploration Ltd, a source close to the deal said without elaborating.</p>
<p>Market sources had told Reuters on Monday that Norway's Saga Petroleum ASA was close to buying Santa Fe for $1.2 billion.</p>
<p>Saga said yesterday it aimed to hold a press conference on Tuesday morning.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
